    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buster Jam is a playable cartoon, focused on fast-paced mini-game action. Explore comedic scenarios as Buster and Bridget, and make your way to each world's animated boss-fight. Its lively style and soundtrack hold inspiration from the '90s and early 2000s, with a splash of its own modern flair.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >STORY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Evil sorcerer <strong>the Wizard</strong> has come out of his long retirement to rule the world. Demolitionists <strong>Buster</strong> and <strong>Bridget</strong> will have to make their way through a variety of zany worlds, and an onslaught of wacky boss-fight scenarios if they want to save the land from a 'Wizard-topia'. With their explosive expertise, and friends along the way, the Wizard will be no match for these go-lucky bombheads.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WHAT NOW?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buster Jam is still in development, and planned to release soon. Wishlist the game to help us, and keep up to date with the project!</p>",
